{
  "source": "Prompts/know-the-app-2.mp4",
  "duration": 166.649625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.64,
      "text": "Point and tap to get a family picture in the dark turn on the flash at a hockey game zoom in"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.16,
      "end": 7.2,
      "text": "AI works similarly"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.9,
      "end": 13.32,
      "text": "Depending on your app in subscription, you have three choices model thinking and research"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 18.28,
      "text": "You won't need to change them every time, but knowing what they do helps you get a better answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 23.86,
      "text": "Think of a large language model or LLM as the engine inside your AI app"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.86,
      "end": 28.26,
      "text": "It's the core system powering responses when an app lets you choose a model"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.26,
      "end": 30.54,
      "text": "You're choosing which LLM to use"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.1,
      "end": 37.44,
      "text": "Different models have different capabilities knowing which to choose helps you get better answers this graphic outlines your choices"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.1,
      "end": 43.64,
      "text": "Which model the everyday model is for quick questions and simple tasks like suggesting a movie"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.64,
      "end": 48.68,
      "text": "The more capable model handles demanding tasks with details like planning a business"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.22,
      "end": 53.86,
      "text": "The guiding rule start with the default try a more capable model when needed"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.5,
      "end": 60.68,
      "text": "Adjusting the model is really just a matter of deciding how much raw horsepower your specific prompt requires before you hit send"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.44,
      "end": 67.94,
      "text": "Before writing an essay you plan you decide what to say pick examples and organize an outline before drafting"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.74,
      "end": 71.58,
      "text": "Choosing a model changes which LLM you use"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.2,
      "end": 75.84,
      "text": "Thinking changes how much time AI spends working through your task"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.58,
      "end": 82.32,
      "text": "AI isn't thinking the way you do but it spends more time working through the task before giving you an answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.32,
      "end": 84.74,
      "text": "Here is how you adjust processing time"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.52,
      "end": 91.26,
      "text": "Less thinking means AI spends less time working through your task useful for routine work like a checklist"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.86,
      "end": 97.48,
      "text": "More thinking means AI spends more time working through steps weighing options and checking its answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.48,
      "end": 100.66,
      "text": "Give AI more time when the task needs more working through"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.46,
      "end": 104.5,
      "text": "Turning on this mode doesn't swap out the engine for a smarter one"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.5,
      "end": 108.92,
      "text": "It simply grants the AI the clock time it needs to weigh options and check its own work"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.72,
      "end": 115.08,
      "text": "Some decisions require a little context ordering a fast food cheeseburger takes no prior research"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.72,
      "end": 121.92,
      "text": "Buying a house however requires you to cross-reference maps compare prices and calculate commutes"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.32,
      "end": 129.18,
      "text": "Regular chat can look things up, but research is useful when you want a fuller investigation across several sources"
    },
    {
      "start": 129.18,
      "end": 132.44,
      "text": "This graphic shows how to choose the right depth"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.44,
      "end": 136.48,
      "text": "Regular chat gets an answer to a single question like driving times"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.48,
      "end": 143.38,
      "text": "Deep research pulls information from many websites compares what they say and builds a report showing sources"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.38,
      "end": 147.42,
      "text": "Use deeper research when you need to compare information across sources"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.0,
      "end": 155.6,
      "text": "This setting transforms the app from a simple reference dictionary into an active investigator pulling data from multiple live websites"
    },
    {
      "start": 155.6,
      "end": 163.0,
      "text": "To get the best results always remember this core rule model thinking research use them when the work demands more"
    }
  ],
